  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "rahela bearn of Egypta lande. \u00deas niht sceolon ealle Israhela bearn begyman, \u00f0e God hi ut al\u00e6dde of Egypta lande. WITODLICE Moyses nam Iosepes ban mid him, for \u00f0am \u00fee he halsode Israhela bearn, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: & hi foron fram Socho & wicodon \u00e6t Etham on \u00feam ytemestan ende \u00fe\u00e6s westenes. & Drihten for beforan heom, & swutelode him \u00feone weg, on d\u00e6g \u00feurh sweart tacn on sweres & symle him gel\u00e6ste \u00fe\u00e6t swearte tacn on d\u00e6g & \u00fe\u00e6t fyrene on niht. DRIHTEN spr\u00e6c to Moyse, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sege Israhela bearnum \u00fe\u00e6t hi gecyrron ongean Phiaroth; Seo & Farao h\u00e6f\u00f0 gegaderod ealne his here & wile eow ofslean, & ic cy\u00f0e on Pharone & on eallum his \u00d0a cydde man Pharaone, hw\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t Israhelisce folc gewicod h\u00e6fde wi\u00f0 \u00f0a Readan S\u00e6; \u00fea wear\u00f0 \u00d0a gegaderode Farao ealle his ealdormenn & ealne his here. & gegaderode six hundred godra crata, \u00f0e man of feohtan mihte on \u00f0am lande, & ealle \u00f0a cratu butan \u00d0a \u00f0\u00e6t Israhelisce folc beseah on Pharaones here, \u00f0a clypodon hi to Moyse, & cw\u00e6don: Earme Nu we moton beon ofslagene on \u00feis westene; betere us w\u00e6re \u00f0\u00e6t we hyrdon Pharaone, urum \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses to \u00f0am folce: Ne ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 eow; standa\u00f0 & geseo\u00fe Drihtnes m\u00e6r\u00f0a, \u00f0e he to d\u00e6g Beo\u00f0 eow stille",
